{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからのプレゼント今日いただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙は途中までかな？読みました！\nまた読み終えたら言いますね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/08/9364220/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさーん！！！\n朗報でーす！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『のぎ天2』始まります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバーの\n貴重な貴重な活躍の場である"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に再開できて\n嬉しいです(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メディアに出ることが少ないから\nどんなに頑張ってても\n気づいてもらいにくいのがアンダーだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この１つがどれだけ大切なことか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年近くアンダーやってる中田を推してるみなさんなら\n知ってると思うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく、\n開始直前！コメント映像 が\nアップされてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/08/9364220/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/186164/?scid=we_ngz_nogiten2"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/08/